  <!--
    FrameworkReference, unlike Humans.Cantina.Tests and like Humans.Scanner.Tests: both test
    classes name ASP.NET types. DevSeedControllerTests constructs the controller and builds a
    DefaultHttpContext; DevPersonaSeederTests substitutes UserManager<User> (Identity). Take
    the reference because a test names one, not because the section is Sdk.Razor
    (G5-SECTION-TEMPLATE.md step 8, Cantina's rule).

    No EF Core package: Development owns no tables and takes no Humans.Infrastructure
    reference, so Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore is not on the compile path — which is why
    tests/Directory.Build.props excludes this project from the shared TestDbContextFactory /
    CapturingLogger compile items. Debug's criterion, stated there: "no EF on the compile
    path", not "the section owns no tables".
  -->
